          "guid": "mspphhjpiu9cn3ig",
          "message": {
            "text": "The retry gate now matches Blink’s three-way Character::IsVariationSequence predicate before consulting cmap-14. Chromium rev 7d859f27 accepts only Emoji+VS15/16, pairs in its generated standardized table, or undecomposed Ideographic+supplementary-VS sequences; treating every adjacent selector as valid spuriously requeued default-ignorables. The focused test proves both sides: Helvetica 0+VS1 enters the unmatched-VS requeue and ignore-VS reset, while a+VS1 does neither.",
            "markdown": "The retry gate now matches Blink’s three-way Character::IsVariationSequence predicate before consulting cmap-14. Chromium rev 7d859f27 accepts only Emoji+VS15/16, pairs in its generated standardized table, or undecomposed Ideographic+supplementary-VS sequences; treating every adjacent selector as valid spuriously requeued default-ignorables. The focused test proves both sides: Helvetica 0+VS1 enters the unmatched-VS requeue and ignore-VS reset, while a+VS1 does neither."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
